
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Omwenga Futuristic Hub | Electronics & Computing</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f4f7fb;
      color: #172033;
    }
    header {
      background: #101b35;
      color: white;
      padding: 24px 16px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    header h1 { margin: 0 0 10px; }
    nav { margin-top: 18px; }
    nav a {
      color: white;
      margin: 0 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .hero {
      padding: 55px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #dcecff;
    }
    .hero h2 { font-size: 32px; }
    .hero p { line-height: 1.7; }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 13px 20px;
      background: #087b50;
      color: white;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }
    main { padding: 28px 16px; max-width: 950px; margin: auto; }
    .products {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .product {
      background: white;
      padding: 24px 16px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 12px #15234412;
    }
    .emoji { font-size: 44px; }
    footer {
      background: #101b35;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 24px 12px;
      margin-top: 25px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Omwenga Futuristic Hub</h1>
    <p>Your destination for electronics and computing devices</p>
    <nav>
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#products">Products</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <h2>Upgrade Your Digital World</h2>
    <p>Explore laptops, smartphones, computer accessories
       and essential technology for work, study and everyday life.</p>
    <a class="button"
       href="https://wa.me/2547XXXXXXXX">
       Enquire on WhatsApp
    </a>
  </section>

  <main id="products">
    <h2 style="text-align:center">Explore Our Products</h2>
    <div class="products">
      <article class="product">
        <div class="emoji">💻</div>
        <h3>Laptops & Computers</h3>
        <p>Devices for business, school and personal use.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="product">
        <div class="emoji">📱</div>
        <h3>Smartphones</h3>
        <p>Discover devices to keep you connected.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="product">
        <div class="emoji">🎧</div>
        <h3>Computer Accessories</h3>
        <p>Keyboards, mice, headsets and more.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="product">
        <div class="emoji">🔌</div>
        <h3>Electronics & Gadgets</h3>
        <p>Useful technology for your everyday needs.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer id="contact">
    <h2>Contact Omwenga Futuristic Hub</h2>
    <p>Have a product in mind? Contact us for availability and prices.</p>
    <p>Serving customers in Kenya.</p>
    <p>© 2026 Omwenga Futuristic Hub</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
